# The one home of Litestream's pin: its version, and the SHA-256 of the linux arm64 archive the box
# runs. ops/release.sh and the deploy job's fetch both read this file, and both refuse an archive
# whose sum is not this one. To move the pin: take the new release's digest from its own page
# (https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream/releases/tag/v<version>, the asset
# litestream-<version>-linux-arm64.tar.gz, or the release's checksums.txt), change both lines here,
# change nothing else. Read 2026-11-12 from the v0.5.18 release's checksums.txt:
# https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream/releases/download/v0.5.18/checksums.txt
LITESTREAM_VERSION=0.5.18
LITESTREAM_ARM64_SHA256=922a09e6a7ac67f2095571894dc6382e94e1dd4cdd9674883ddf1a8e74ab982d
